
>> Animal := Yam-khoom tshiab.
Animal thaum-tuaj: ['tshiab'] ua: { <- tus-kheej tshiab init.
}.

Animal thaum-tuaj: ['init'] ua: {
	nws-li sound := ['?'].
	nws-li legs := 4.
}.

>> Dog := Animal tshiab.
Dog thaum-tuaj: ['init'] ua: {
	tus-kheej init.
	nws-li sound := ['barks'].
}.

Animal thaum-tuaj: ['kab-ntawv'] ua: { <- nws-li legs kab-ntawv + nws-li sound.
}.

>> poodle := Dog tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: poodle, kab-tshiab.

